BRING UP CLUSTER

```
ansible -i inventory.yml all -b -a 'dnf update -y'          
ansible -i inventory.yml all -b -a 'dnf install -y kernel-modules-extra'
ansible -i inventory.yml all -b -a 'reboot'
```
then:

```
ansible-playbook -i inventory.yml site.yml

```
Remove old kernels:
```
sudo dnf remove --oldinstallonly --setopt installonly_limit=2 kernel

```
